### TITLE ###
EnterOpensALineWhileTheBufferIsIncomplete
### DESCRIPTION ###
The caller's IsComplete hook decides. Here a trailing colon holds the buffer
open, the continuation prompt marks the new line, and the indent hook puts the
cursor one level in.
### PROMPT ###
>
### CONT_PROMPT ###
.
### POLICY ###
block
### KEYS ###
"if x:"
enter
"pass"
enter
enter
### VALUE ###
if x:
    pass
\"    "
### OUTCOME ###
submitted
