### TITLE ###
NestedBlocksKeepIndentingUntilTheBlankLine
### DESCRIPTION ###
Each colon adds a level and the indent carries to the next line, so a nested
body lands where the writer expects rather than back at column zero.
### PROMPT ###
>
### CONT_PROMPT ###
.
### POLICY ###
block
### KEYS ###
"if a:"
enter
"if b:"
enter
"deep"
enter
enter
### VALUE ###
if a:
    if b:
        deep
\"        "
### OUTCOME ###
submitted
